     1	"""Score saved runtime decisions through the SF2 gate; no inference.
     2	
     3	The old component/proxy arithmetic is agreement_mode_historical.py. This command
     4	requires detector, coverage and R1 predictions, exactly as M2 and L1r do.
     5	"""
