     2	
     3	No Google/human text, lexicon, truth labels or recogniser forward pass enters here.
     4	Use read_line_details for parallel unnamed/localisation flags, constraint
     5	constraint flags and held-back/tied proposals. Print output preserves detected
     6	marks. Only output="normalised" may remove marks; filtered=False is raw replay.
